1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Doctors put a TOOTH

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,990
inside this man’s EYE…

3
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:04,750
and he could SEE AGAIN.

4
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:06,560
His cornea was so damaged,

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,570
a normal transplant wouldn’t work.

6
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:09,530
So surgeons removed

7
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:10,250
one of his teeth

8
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:11,480
with a piece of bone,

9
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,705
drilled a hole through it,

10
00:00:12,745 --> 00:00:14,860
and fitted a clear lens inside.

11
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,970
They tucked it beneath the skin

12
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:17,700
near his other eye for months,

13
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,890
letting living tissue grow around it.

14
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,210
Then they implanted it

15
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,610
into his damaged eye,

16
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,730
allowing light to reach his retina.

17
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:26,970
After TEN YEARS blind…

18
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,330
he could see again.

